  (text "J2 'Low' lands on the preamp-volume network's own input node: the drawing wires the coupler C3 to that jack's normalling contact, so with nothing plugged into Low" (at 20.1 80.11 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left)) (uuid "dd9c9645-e847-4ff7-b214-c1540f681302"))
  (text "the two are joined and the cascaded front end runs normally, and a plug in Low substitutes the guitar for V1a's output. 'X', 'Y' and 'Z' are the sheets' own interconnections." (at 20.1 84.11 0)
